or “villagers” (Gen. 10:17; 1 Chr. 1:15).","verses":9,"father":"Canaan","mother":"","v":[2]},{"id":"levi_1820","name":"Levi","also":"","summary":"The third son of Jacob by Leah. The origin of the name is found in Leah’s words (Gen. 29:34), “This time will my husband be joined [Heb. yillaveh] unto me.”","verses":64,"father":"Israel","mother":"Leah","v":[25,30]},{"id":"simeon_2741","name":"Simeon","also":"","summary":"The second son of Jacob by Leah (Gen. 29:33). He was associated with Levi in the terrible act of vengeance against Hamor and the Shechemites (34:25, 26).","verses":40,"father":"Israel","mother":"Leah","v":[25,30]}],"places":[{"id":"shechem_1069","name":"Shechem","kind":"City","lat":32.22111,"lon":35.25444,"summary":"A city in Samaria (Gen. 33:18), called also Sichem (12:6), Sychem (Acts 7:16). It stood in the narrow sheltered valley between Ebal on the north and Gerizim on the south, these mountains at their base being only some 500 yards apart.","verses":40,"v":[2]}],"events":[{"id":"death_of_moses_129","title":"Death of Moses","year":-1452,"summary":"Passage: Genesis 34:1 – Deuteronomy 34:12. People: Moses. Place: mount Nebo.","v":[1]}],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[1783,1783,1323,1323,3812,3205,3205,3290,3290,3318,3318,7200,7200,1323,1323,776,776,776],[7927,7927,1121,2544,2544,2340,2340,5387,5387,776,776,776,7200,853,3947,3947,853,7901,7901,854,854,6031,6031],[5315,5315,5315,1692,1692,1783,1783,1323,1323,3290,3290,157,157,5291,5291,5291,1696,1696,1696,1696,1696],[7927,7927,559,1,1,2544,3947,0,2063,3207,802,802,802],[3290,8085,3588,2930,2930,2930,1323,1323,1783,1121,1121,1121,1121,1961,854,4735,4735,7704,7704,7704,3290,2790,2790,2790,2790,5704,935,935],[7927,7927,1,2544,3318,1696,1696,854,3290],[3290,3290,1121,8085,8085,8085,8085,935,935,4480,7704,7704,3966,3966,3966,3966,6087,2734,2734,3588,6213,6213,6213,5039,5039,3478,3478,7901,7901,853,3290,1323,3651,3808,3808,3808,6213,6213],[2544,2544,1696,854,854,1121,1121,792